## 1. Result Summary
We successfully investigated the ZV2 zone planner data sources, confirmed the feasibility of 1-year historical data extraction, validated it against Confluence mappings, and verified the overbilling root cause by correlating Sawmill billing logs with Mastermind physical traffic.

